    {"type":"text","id":"daemon_body","x":395,"y":220,"width":230,"height":310,"text":"• Webhook server (Fastify)\n• Tunnel mgr (ngrok)\n• Reminder + diary schedulers\n• Profile watcher\n\n• Event bus\n  (pub/sub; events table\n   audits; durable cursors)\n\n• Dispatchers:\n   mind (serialized)\n   diary (always-fresh)\n   cold-start\n   execution (task.fired)\n\n• MCP servers (subprocess):\n   substrate × 3 (per role)\n   surface (principal CC)\n   external lifecycle","originalText":"• Webhook server (Fastify)\n• Tunnel mgr (ngrok)\n• Reminder + diary schedulers\n• Profile watcher\n\n• Event bus\n  (pub/sub; events table\n   audits; durable cursors)\n\n• Dispatchers:\n   mind (serialized)\n   diary (always-fresh)\n   cold-start\n   execution (task.fired)\n\n• MCP servers (subprocess):\n   substrate × 3 (per role)\n   surface (principal CC)\n   external lifecycle","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300005,"version":1,"versionNonce":300006,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.4},
